## Getting started

Open in VS Code and "Reopen in Container" (or run `nix develop` if you have Nix
installed), then:

```sh
composer install
composer test
```

## Checks

- `composer format` / `composer format:check` — PHP-CS-Fixer
- `composer analyse` — PHPStan
- `composer test` — {{ test_framework }}

See `AGENTS.md` for AI-assistant rules.
